1
00:00:05,846 --> 00:00:11,186
All right, Ms. Jensen, before we begin,
may I offer you a refreshment?

2
00:00:11,351 --> 00:00:13,551
Water, coffee, tea?

3
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,850
(Sheldon:)A marijuana cigarette?

4
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:18,350
(Ms Jenson:)No, thanks, I'm fine.

5
00:00:18,525 --> 00:00:22,325
(Sheldon:)Are you sure?
Everyone's smoking them.

6
00:00:22,896 --> 00:00:25,386
(Sheldon:)I think they're the best.

7
00:00:25,966 --> 00:00:27,896
- I don't do drugs.
- Excellent.

8
00:00:28,101 --> 00:00:29,401
(Sheldon:)Yeah. That was a ruse.

9
00:00:29,603 --> 00:00:33,043
(Sheldon:)They're not the best. Physics is the best.

10
00:00:33,507 --> 00:00:36,537
(Sheldon:)By the way, coffee was also
an unacceptable choice.

11
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:40,670
(Sheldon:)All right, so I see here
you're from Des Moines, Iowa.

12
00:00:40,847 --> 00:00:44,577
(Sheldon:)You're summa cum laude in theoretical
physics from Stanford University.

13
00:00:44,751 --> 00:00:49,381
(Sheldon:)Oh, and two years ago
you had a persistent ear infection.

14
00:00:49,556 --> 00:00:51,816
(Sheldon:)I hope that didn't cause
any hearing loss.

15
00:00:51,992 --> 00:00:53,582
(Ms Jenson:)No, of course not.

16
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,190
(Ms Jenson:)How did you know about that?

17
00:00:55,362 --> 00:00:57,522
Well, I did a comprehensive
background check.

18
00:00:57,698 --> 00:01:01,258
(Sheldon:)Medical records, credit reports,
criminal history.

